<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41192" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rĕ-pigro</span></b> , no <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>perf.</i>, ātum,
			1, v. a.
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>To make slothful</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">uxoris Cyllenius fotibus repigratus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart. Cap. 1, § 35</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>to check</i>, <i>keep back</i>, <i>retard</i>
			(post-class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dirarum bestiarum impetum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 8, p. 208, 19</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">p. 175 Bip.: repigrato fetu,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 1</span></i>
			, p. 106, 21.— Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rĕpigrātus</span></b> , a, um,
				P. a., <i>retarded</i>, <i>slow</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">repigratior paululum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart. Cap. 1, § 36</span></i>
			 (al. repigritior).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
